        {
          "loreEntryElementType": {
            "id": "01GR6AENPX6HQP8G16KNV7BNA2",
            "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
            "subject": "Flavor Text"
          },
          "translations": {
            "fr_FR": {
              "text": "Toujours avide de nouvelles idées.",
              "locale": "fr_FR"
            },
            "en_US": {
              "text": "Always hungry for new ideas...",
              "locale": "en_US"
            }
          },
          "id": "01HNJH679RM2RTP6RM8AN4PBQX",
          "text": "Always hungry for new ideas..."
        },
        {
          "loreEntryElementType": {
            "id": "01GR6AE2ZSVVYP6SDJXN8Q5DVF",
            "reference": "STORY",
            "subject": "Story"
          },
          "translations": {
            "en_US": {
              "text": "Hunger... It's always there, like a void that seeks only to devour everything. I can only sate it for a while, but it always comes back, demanding its due, growling for a new offering. It's there, like a bottomless pit. It's there, like a master that can never be satisfied. Hunger... I know that nothing – no sacrifice, no libation – can make it feel any sense of satisfaction. It's there, like an open maw with sharp fangs. It's there, with the ultimate goal of gobbling up everything. Because it knows that there's a meal here much more nourishing than a mere series of ideas. It devours. It gnashes. It salivates at the idea of its next feast...",
              "locale": "en_US"
            },
            "fr_FR": {
              "text": "La faim... Elle est toujours là, comme un vide qui n'aspire qu'à tout dévorer. Je ne peux que l'apaiser un temps, mais elle revient toujours, exigeant son dû, grondant pour qu'on lui fasse une nouvelle offrande. Elle est là, comme un gouffre. Elle est là, comme une maîtresse que jamais rien ne vient contenter. La faim... Je sais que rien — aucun sacrifice, nulle libation — ne parviendra à lui faire ressentir une quelconque sensation de satiété. Elle est là, comme une gueule ouverte, aux crocs acérés. Elle est là, avec pour objectif, à terme, de tout engloutir. Car elle sait qu'il y a ici une pitance bien plus nourrissante qu'un chapelet d'idées. Elle dévore. Elle broie. Elle salive à l'idée de son prochain festin...",
              "locale": "fr_FR"
            }
          },
          "id": "01HNJH67AZEXQ9R3SXTZV2CWYE",
          "text": "Hunger... It's always there, like a void that seeks only to devour everything. I can only sate it for a while, but it always comes back, demanding its due, growling for a new offering. It's there, like a bottomless pit. It's there, like a master that can never be satisfied. Hunger... I know that nothing – no sacrifice, no libation – can make it feel any sense of satisfaction. It's there, like an open maw with sharp fangs. It's there, with the ultimate goal of gobbling up everything. Because it knows that there's a meal here much more nourishing than a mere series of ideas. It devours. It gnashes. It salivates at the idea of its next feast..."
        },
